' U8 · ERD fisik (draft 0.10, 31 Oktober 2026, sumber migrasi 00001 sampai 00011 di sql/migrations)
' Menggambarkan tabel PostgreSQL 18 yang sudah dibangun sampai M3.1 (R-UML-03: diagram
' fisik mengikuti kode per milestone). Tim IT boleh memakai stack lain (R-UML-02); aturan yang
' wajib dipertahankan ditulis di catatan setiap diagram.
'
' Konvensi:
'   * di depan kolom   = NOT NULL
'   <<PK>> <<FK>> <<UK>> = primary key, foreign key, unique
'   kolom tanpa *       = boleh kosong
'   uuid diisi uuidv7() bila tidak disebut lain (urut menurut waktu dibuat)
'   |o pada ujung induk = foreign key boleh kosong; semua garis utuh, karena garis
'   putus-putus di paket ini berarti tindakan di atas kertas (README, Konvensi)
'
' Render dari folder docs/uml (belum dirender di draft ini, lihat README):
'   java -jar plantuml-1.2026.9.jar -tsvg -o export U8-erd.puml

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@startuml U8-A-master-data
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ClassBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

title U8-A · Master data customer, model, dan proses (migrasi 00001, 00005, 00006)

entity "project_groups" as project_groups {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * code : text <<UK>>
  * name : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "customers" as customers {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * code : text <<UK>>
  * name : text
  project_group_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * active : boolean = true
  default_route_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "customer_codes" as customer_codes {
  * code : text <<PK>>
  --
  * customer_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * valid_from : timestamptz
  valid_until : timestamptz
}

entity "model_groups" as model_groups {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * customer_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * name : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "models" as models {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * customer_id : uuid <<FK>>
  model_group_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * name : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "part_numbers" as part_numbers {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * customer_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * model_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * number : text
  name : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "processes" as processes {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "process_names" as process_names {
  * name_key : text <<PK>> = lower(name)
  --
  * process_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * kind : text
  * name : text
}

entity "approval_routes" as approval_routes_a {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
}

project_groups |o--o{ customers
customers ||--o{ customer_codes
customers ||--o{ model_groups
customers ||--o{ models
model_groups |o--o{ models
models ||--o{ part_numbers
processes ||--|{ process_names
approval_routes_a |o--o{ customers

note right of customers
  code: ^[A-Z]{2}$, bukan ZZ (D-89), sama dengan
  kode berlaku di customer_codes (E-11, D-88).
  name: 1 sampai 200 karakter tanpa spasi di tepi (E-21).
  Tidak pernah dihapus, hanya active = false (D-86).
  project_group_id wajib di layanan; kolomnya boleh
  kosong untuk data sebelum M1.4.
end note

note bottom of customer_codes
  Riwayat kode (D-88). Satu kode hanya pernah milik
  satu customer (PK code, D-109).
  UNIQUE (customer_id) WHERE valid_until IS NULL:
  tepat satu kode berlaku per customer.
  UNIQUE (code, customer_id): sasaran foreign key
  gabungan dari document_numbers (00010).
end note

note bottom of models
  UNIQUE (customer_id, name).
  FK (model_group_id, customer_id) -> model_groups (id, customer_id):
  group model harus milik customer yang sama (D-42).
end note

note bottom of part_numbers
  UNIQUE (customer_id, number).
  FK (model_id, customer_id) -> models (id, customer_id).
end note

note bottom of process_names
  kind: display (tepat satu per proses) atau alias.
  name_key = lower(name) adalah PK: nama dan alias semua
  proses berbagi satu ruang nama tanpa membedakan
  huruf besar kecil (D-110). Proses tidak pernah dihapus.
end note
@enduml

